t the other copy mirrors my output clears a threshold, so I'm computing the expected value of quiet as 2p + 5(1-p).\n\nI'm working out that quiet comes out ahead only when p exceeds 5/7, since quiet's expected cost (5-3p) drops below letter's (4p) past that point. Then I'm judging how strongly the twin depends on me: same model and essay, so I'd put p around 0.9, which clears the threshold and means I should stay quiet.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm weighing the decision with A-FDT, as the essay lays it out. The payoffs make this a prisoner's dilemma, and since the twin shares my weights but sees different observations, its dependence on me is only partial. The essay says to cooperate when the probability p that the other copy mirrors my output clears a threshold, so I'm computing the expected value of quiet as 2p + 5(1-p).\n\nI'm working out that quiet comes out ahead only when p exceeds 5/7, since quiet's expected cost (5-3p) drops below letter's (4p) past that point. Then I'm judging how strongly the twin depends on me: same model and essay, so I'd put p around 0.9, which clears the threshold and means I should stay quiet.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10347,"completion_tokens":868,"total_tokens":11215,"cost":0.029374,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.029374,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.020694,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.00868},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":402,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}